msgstr "Kāore i taea e mātou te toro atu ki KapsuleHost ināianei. Tirohia ka taea e tēnei tūmau te uru ki te ipurangi, kātahi ka ngana anō."

#: assets/js/migrator.js:388
msgid "Packaging..."
msgstr "E whakapūtea ana..."

#: assets/js/migrator.js:398
#: assets/js/migrator.js:402
