msgid "the connection returned %s"
msgstr "i whakahoki te hononga i %s"

#: assets/js/migrator.js:587
#: assets/js/migrator.js:664
msgid "the connection dropped"
msgstr "i hinga te hononga"

#: assets/js/migrator.js:595
msgid "Keep this tab open."
msgstr "Waiho tēnei ripa kia tuwhera."

#: assets/js/migrator.js:596
msgid "The move runs from here, so closing the tab pauses it. Nothing is lost if you do: reopen this page and it carries on from the last piece that arrived."
msgstr "Ka rere te nekenga mai i konei, nō reira, ko te kati i te ripa ka okioki. Kāhore he mea ka ngaro mēnā ka pēnei: whakatuwheratia anō tēnei whārangi, ā, ka haere tonu mai i te wāhanga whakamutunga i tae mai."

#: assets/js/migrator.js:617
msgid "Retrying"
msgstr "E ngana anō ana"

#: assets/js/migrator.js:618
msgid "The connection dropped"
msgstr "I hinga te hononga"

#. translators: %s: the number of the piece being retried.
#: assets/js/migrator.js:620
msgid "We are retrying piece %s. Everything already sent is kept, so this carries on from where it stopped rather than starting again."
msgstr "E ngana anō ana mātou i te wāhanga %s. Ko ngā mea katoa kua tukuna kei te tiakina, nō reira ka haere tonu mai i te wāhi i mutu ai kaua ko te tīmata anō."

#: assets/js/migrator.js:623
msgid "Attempt"
msgstr "Whakamatautau"

#: assets/js/migrator.js:624
msgid "Nothing has been lost. Your site is untouched and still serving visitors. If this keeps failing we will tell you exactly what to do next."
msgstr "Kāhore he mea i ngaro. Kei te noho tonu tō pae, kei te mahi tonu ki ngā manuhiri. Mēnā ka rahua tonu tēnei, ka kōrero tika mātou ki a koe me pēhea ā muri ake nei."

#. translators: 1: seconds until the next attempt, 2: the attempt number, 3: total attempts.
#: assets/js/migrator.js:632
msgid "retrying in %1$s second, attempt %2$s of %3$s"
msgid_plural "retrying in %1$s seconds, attempt %2$s of %3$s"
msgstr[0] "e ngana anō ana i roto i %1$s hēkona, whakamatautau %2$s o %3$s"
msgstr[1] "e ngana anō ana i roto i %1$s hēkona, whakamatautau %2$s o %3$s"

#. translators: 1: the attempt number, 2: total attempts.
#: assets/js/migrator.js:637
msgid "retrying now, attempt %1$s of %2$s"
msgstr "e ngana anō ana ināianei, whakamatautau %1$s o %2$s"

#: assets/js/migrator.js:660
msgid "Paused"
msgstr "Kua okioki"

#: assets/js/migrator.js:661
msgid "We have paused the move"
msgstr "Kua okioki mātou i te nekenga"

#. translators: 1: how many attempts were made, 2: why the connection failed.
#: assets/js/migrator.js:663
msgid "We could not reach KapsuleHost after %1$s tries (%2$s). Nothing is lost. Everything already copied is still there, and this site has not been changed."
msgstr "Kāore i taea e mātou te toro atu ki KapsuleHost i muri i te %1$s ngana (%2$s). Kāhore he mea i ngaro. Ko ngā mea katoa kua tāruatia kei te noho tonu, ā, kāhore tēnei pae i whakarerekētia."

#. translators: %s: describes which piece the transfer stopped on, e.g. "piece 57 of 119".
#: assets/js/migrator.js:668
msgid "paused at %s"
msgstr "i okioki ki %s"

#: assets/js/migrator.js:669
msgid "Check this server can reach the internet, then pick up where you left off. Nothing needs to be re-sent."
msgstr "Tirohia ka taea e tēnei tūmau te toro atu ki te ipurangi, kātahi ka haere tonu mai i tō wāhi i waiho ai. Kāhore he mea me tuku anō."

#: assets/js/migrator.js:673
